---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Chai & Coffee in East Vancouver | Sula Café"
	description="An East Vancouver coffee shop. Sula chai brewed slow from Coorg leaves, Alai Coffee blend, croissants baked daily. Drop by 260 East 5th Ave."
	canonical="/"
	ogImage="/uploads/2026/02/sula-cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp"
>

	<section class="hero is-split">
		<div class="hero-figure" aria-hidden="true">
			<img src="/uploads/2026/02/sula-cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
		</div>
		<div class="hero-content">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">From the Sula Indian Restaurant team</span>
			<h1 class="has-accent">Brewed slow.<br/><em>Made to be remembered.</em></h1>
			<p class="hero-lede">
				A takeout <a href="/coffee-and-chai-in-vancouver" class="body-link">coffee shop in East Vancouver</a>.
				Authentic Sula chai, Alai Coffee, and bakery fresh every morning.
			</p>
			<div class="hero-buttons">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					Order on UberEats
					<svg class="cta-chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a href="/menu" class="btn-outline-cocoa">
					See the menu
					<svg class="cta-chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-reverse reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-img cocoa">
				<img width="600" height="900" src="/uploads/2026/02/chai-near-me-vancouver-sula-chai-cafe.webp" alt="Masala chai brewed at Sula Café in Vancouver with Coorg and Chikmagalur tea leaves" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic"><span class="sec-num">№ 01</span>Sula Chai</span>
				<h2 class="has-accent">Tea leaves from <em>Coorg &amp; Chikmagalur.</em></h2>
				<p>
					The Scotland of India. Cool, misty highlands produce aromatic, full-bodied teas. Five
					blends, brewed slow with traditional spices. Want the longer story? Walk the
					<a href="/coffee-and-chai-in-vancouver" class="body-link">spice trail</a>.
				</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag">Masala</span>
					<span class="tag">Lavender</span>
					<span class="tag">Pistachio</span>
					<span class="tag">Gulabi</span>
					<span class="tag">Spicy Ginger</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic"><span class="sec-num">№ 02</span>Alai Coffee</span>
				<h2>Crafted by Alai. Brewed at Sula.</h2>
				<p>
					Our exclusive Sula Blend by <a href="https://alaicoffee.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="body-link">Alai Coffee</a>.
					Single-origin from Chikmagalur and Odisha. Specialty coffee inspired by Indian
					dessert traditions.
				</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Jaggery Velvet Latte</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Coastal Coconut Cap</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Malai Pista Mocha</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Indian Filter Coffee</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-img espresso">
				<img width="600" height="900" src="/uploads/2026/02/alai-coffee-vancouver.webp" alt="Alai Coffee Sula Blend, specialty coffee roasted in Vancouver from Chikmagalur and Odisha beans" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic"><span class="sec-num">№ 03</span>The Bakery</span>
				<h2>Indian neighbourhood bakeries, with a Vancouver twist.</h2>
				<p>
					Spiced cookies, chai-infused cakes, paninis on house-made masala focaccia. Fresh
					every morning. Slow-laminated. We've been writing about
					<a href="/blog/pastries-coffee-pairing" class="body-link">pairings and pastries</a> over in the journal.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="bakery-spread">
				<a href="/menu#sweets" class="photo-card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img width="1200" height="1800" src="/uploads/2025/10/Coconut-lime-cruffin.webp" alt="Lime coconut cruffin and fresh-baked pastries from Sula Café in East Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sweet pastries</span>
						<h3>Cruffins &amp; croissants</h3>
						<p>Lime coconut. Tiramisu. Orange chocolate pain suisse. Pistachio loaf. All baked daily.</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<a href="/menu#savory" class="photo-card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img width="1200" height="1800" src="/uploads/2025/10/Pesto-chicken-tikka-panini.webp" alt="Pesto chicken tikka panini on house-made masala focaccia at Sula Café Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Masala focaccia</span>
						<h3>Paneer &amp; chicken paninis</h3>
					</div>
				</a>

				<a href="/menu#cookies" class="photo-card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img width="1200" height="1800" src="/uploads/2025/10/cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp" alt="Brown butter espresso cookies and macaroons at Sula Café Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Cookies &amp; treats</span>
						<h3>Cookies &amp; macaroons</h3>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-espresso reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic"><span class="sec-num">№ 04</span>Catering &amp; Events</span>
			<h2 class="has-accent h-anchor">Bring Sula <em>to your gathering.</em></h2>
			<div class="lux-rule"><span class="lx-line"></span><span class="lx-diamond"></span><span class="lx-line"></span></div>
			<p class="catering-lede">
				Live chai bars, specialty coffee, and bakery boxes for weddings, corporate events,
				and private parties. We also do <a href="/wholesale" class="body-link body-link-light">wholesale</a> for cafés and offices.
			</p>
			<div class="catering-buttons">
				<a href="/catering" class="cta">
					Explore catering
					<svg class="cta-chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a href="/wholesale" class="btn-outline-cream">
					Wholesale bakery
					<svg class="cta-chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-deep reveal" id="faq">
		<div class="container container-narrow">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic"><span class="sec-num">№ 05</span>Common Questions</span>
				<h2>Things people often ask.</h2>
				<p>Quick answers from the team behind the counter.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-list">
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Where are you located?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>260 East 5th Avenue in East Vancouver, just off Main Street. Easy to spot, easier to find a chai you'll actually remember.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">What are your hours?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Open daily. Monday through Friday from 8am to 5:30pm, weekends 9am to 5:30pm.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Is Sula Café takeout only?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes. We're built for grab-and-go. There's a few seats inside if you want to sit with your cup, but the vibe is takeout first.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Do you offer catering?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>We do. Live chai bars, specialty coffee, fresh-baked pastries, and bakery boxes for offices, weddings, and private parties. See our <a href="/catering">catering for events in Vancouver</a>.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Can I order online?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes, we're on UberEats. Full menu, delivery to your door. Or call ahead and we'll have it ready for pickup.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">What chai blends do you serve?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Five blends, each brewed slow with whole spices. Classic masala, lavender, pistachio, spicy ginger, and gulabi rose. Browse our <a href="/menu">specialty chai in Vancouver</a> menu for the full list.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Do you have vegan or gluten-free options?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Plenty. Our vegan options span chai (just ask for oat or coconut milk), pastries, and a sugar-free morning glory muffin. Gluten-free items available too, just ask the team.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Is there parking?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Free street parking on East 5th. Paid lots nearby on Main Street. Cycling? We've got racks out front.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script type="application/ld+json" slot="schema" set:html={JSON.stringify({
		"@context": "https://schema.org",
		"@type": "FAQPage",
		"mainEntity": [
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Where are you located?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "260 East 5th Avenue in East Vancouver, just off Main Street. Easy to spot, easier to find a chai you'll actually remember." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "What are your hours?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Open daily. Monday through Friday from 8am to 5:30pm, weekends 9am to 5:30pm." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Is Sula Café takeout only?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. We're built for grab-and-go. There's a few seats inside if you want to sit with your cup, but the vibe is takeout first." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you offer catering?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We do. Live chai bars, specialty coffee, fresh-baked pastries, and bakery boxes for offices, weddings, and private parties. See our catering for events in Vancouver." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Can I order online?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, we're on UberEats. Full menu, delivery to your door. Or call ahead and we'll have it ready for pickup." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "What chai blends do you serve?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Five blends, each brewed slow with whole spices. Classic masala, lavender, pistachio, spicy ginger, and gulabi rose. Browse our specialty chai in Vancouver menu for the full list." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have vegan or gluten-free options?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Plenty. Our vegan options span chai (just ask for oat or coconut milk), pastries, and a sugar-free morning glory muffin. Gluten-free items available too, just ask the team." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Is there parking?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Free street parking on East 5th. Paid lots nearby on Main Street. Cycling? We've got racks out front." } }
		]
	})} />

	<section class="section section-cocoa reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic visit-eyebrow"><span class="sec-num">№ 06</span>Visit Us</span>
			<h2 class="has-accent h-anchor">Find us in <em>East Vancouver.</em></h2>
			<div class="visit-info">
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Address</div>
					<div class="value">260 East 5th Ave</div>
				</div>
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Service</div>
					<div class="value">Takeout · UberEats</div>
				</div>
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Call</div>
					<div class="value">778-386-1130</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="visit-cta">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					Order on UberEats
					<svg class="cta-chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<style>
		.catering-lede{max-width:660px;margin:24px auto 40px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.62}
		.catering-buttons{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
		.visit-eyebrow{color:var(--burnt-light)}
		.visit-cta{margin-top:56px}
		.body-link{color:var(--burnt);border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in oklab,var(--burnt) 35%,transparent);transition:color 0.3s ease,border-color 0.3s ease}
		.body-link:hover{color:var(--burnt-deep);border-bottom-color:var(--burnt)}
		.body-link-light{color:var(--burnt-light)}
	</style>

</Layout>
